<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Low Stock Alert</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      h1 { color: #c0392b; font-size: 20px; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 16px; }
      th { background-color: #f8f9fa; text-align: left; padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6; font-size: 13px; color: #666; }
      td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6; font-size: 14px; }
      .badge-low { background-color: #fff3cd; color: #856404; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
      .badge-critical { background-color: #f8d7da; color: #842029; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
      .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #999; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 16px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>⚠️ Low Stock Alert</h1>
    <p>Hello, <strong><%= @restaurant.name %></strong> team.</p>
    <p>The following products are at or below their configured minimum stock level and require restocking:</p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Product</th>
          <th>Current Stock</th>
          <th>Minimum Required</th>
          <th>Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% @low_stock_items.each do |item| %>
          <tr>
            <td><%= item.product.name %></td>
            <td><%= item.quantity %></td>
            <td><%= item.minimum_stock %></td>
            <td>
              <% if item.quantity == 0 %>
                <span class="badge-critical">Out of stock</span>
              <% else %>
                <span class="badge-low">Low stock</span>
              <% end %>
            </td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Please restock these products to avoid service disruptions.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      Restaurant Platform — Automated inventory alert system
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

